- **2024-01-11 · The Deutsch Files I** · https://nav.al/deutsch-files-i · Naval, Hall, Deutsch; 54 min. Naval: creativity is often mistaken for remixing; humans leap by discarding vast possibilities fast; ChatGPT extrapolates more than it synthesizes; AI mainly removes drudgery, it isn't AGI; Ted Chiang's "Understand" is a favorite; Taking Children Seriously as non-coercive child-rearing. Deutsch: ChatGPT is useful but unintelligent; AGI is possible but superintelligence beyond explanation is not; personhood is binary, defined by universal explanation; anti-Enlightenment fads are the existential threat.

